Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.10,0:00:04.82,Hook,,0,0,0,,最重要的升级\N不是「{\c&H004DE6FF&}更会聊天{\c&H00FFFFFF&}」
Dialogue: 2,0:00:04.82,0:00:12.22,Section,,0,0,0,,01  /  FROM PROMPT TO PRODUCT
Dialogue: 2,0:00:12.22,0:00:19.22,Section,,0,0,0,,02  /  PROGRAMMATIC TOOLS
Dialogue: 2,0:00:19.22,0:00:26.58,Section,,0,0,0,,03  /  PARALLEL SUBAGENTS
